# Wave W17-Y (Vernal Path): vernal sand — the hushed lane’s pale sand, design-authorised: a pale quiet sand running between the flower banks from the meadow road to Farewell Spring, kept soft-toned so the banks carry the colour (design: the lane the seasons use; renamed in-plan — the draft bloomfloor is a shipped kind). Split from Route 214’s verge sand beside it by hush entire and from Farewell Spring’s spring path ahead by the banks: this sand is flowered over, that one is pooled.
